        "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a202cd-2d0f-76f1-94ee-1a7b82ad1ca8 -->\n**Warning** \u00b7 First history page waits for a full delivery-table scan after upgrade\n\nMigration `002_pending_by_queue.sql` scans every delivery, including completed rows, before the first `history` command on a version-1 database.\n\nA fixed-size page waits for work that grows with the entire table.\n\nBuild the index in an explicit upgrade step outside the `history` command.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Details</summary>\n\nBefore this change, a version-1 database had no pending migration, and `history --limit 10` could read just 11 rows in descending primary-key order. This change adds a synchronous scan of all N deliveries plus index construction for P pending rows, even when P is zero.\n\n</details>\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a202a0-cd61-7684-99bc-53c775b0de50/reviews/01a202cb-ac5f-769c-a172-7242b7b635c2/findings/01a202cd-2d1c-770d-968d-864b5859fcd3)",
